# Rust
/target

.env
*.log

# The dataset artifacts are large derived blobs, not source. They're fetched from the den-dataset
# `data-latest` release via `scripts/fetch-dataset.sh` and baked into / mounted on the image — never committed.
data/*.json
data/*.bin
data/*.gz
data/*.store
!data/.gitkeep
# Side-by-side copies of other generations, for comparing one against another locally. Same class of
# thing as `data/`, same reasons, and 159 MB of it was showing up untracked in every status.
data-*/
